<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Scharrighuisen Holdings raises yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Scharrighuisen Holdings raises yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     80.9	  vs  78.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 20.0	  vs  18.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   26.49	 vs  31.85</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   47.32	 vs  38.57</p>
<p>    Tax			  3.88	 vs   2.61 rebate</p>
<p>    Net finance charges   11.69	 vs  10.03</p>
<p>    Turnover		 405.54	 vs 343.61</p>
<p>Div payable May 23</p>
<p>on register April 30</p>
<p>Full name: Scharrighuisen Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items    -	    vs   6.76</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said that 1995's comparative dividend is in specie.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
